#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:product.template,description:agri_equipment_rental.product_product_12_product_template
msgid ""
"120 hp, Diesel<br>7.0 m Lift Height<br>3,500 kg Max Payload<br>4-Wheel "
"Steering"
msgstr ""
"120 ແຮງມ້າ, ກາຊວນ<br>ລວງສູງຍົກ 7.0 ມ.<br>ນ້ຳໜັກບັນທຸກສູງສຸດ 3,500 ກິໂລ<br>ລະບົບລ້ຽວ 4 ລໍ້"

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:product.template,description:agri_equipment_rental.product_product_10_product_template
msgid ""
"15 hp, Diesel<br>1,200 L/min Flow Rate<br>6 bar Max Pressure<br>Trailer "
"Mounted"
msgstr ""
"15 ແຮງມ້າ, ກາຊວນ<br>ອັດຕາການໄຫຼ 1,200 ລິດ/ນາທີ<br>ແຮງດັນສູງສຸດ 6 ບາ<br>ຕິດເທິງລົດລາກ"

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:product.template,description:agri_equipment_rental.product_product_7_product_template
msgid ""
"15' Working Width<br>12-Blade Disc Gangs<br>Adjustable Depth "
"Control<br>Standard Category 2 Mount"
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າກວ້າງເຮັດວຽກ 15 ຟຸດ<br>ຊຸດຈານໄຖ 12 ໃບ<br>ຄວບຄຸມລະດັບຄວາມເລິກໄດ້<br>ຈຸດຕິດມາດຕະຖານ ປະເ"
"ພດ 2"

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:product.template,description:agri_equipment_rental.product_product_8_product_template
msgid ""
"15' Working Width<br>24 Row Units<br>1,200 L Hopper Capacity<br>No-Till "
"Capable"
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າກວ້າງເຮັດວຽກ 15 ຟຸດ<br>24 ແຖວປູກ<br>ຄວາມຈຸຖັງບັນຈຸ 1,200 ລິດ<br>ຮອງຮັບການປູກແບບບໍ່ໄຖດິນ"

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:product.template,description:agri_equipment_rental.product_product_14_product_template
msgid ""
"150 kg Hammer Weight<br>Hydraulic Tilt/Side-shift<br>Fits Cat 1/2 "
"Hitches<br>Quick-Attach Compatible"
msgstr ""
"ນ້ຳໜັກຄ້ອນ 150 ກິໂລ<br>ປັບອຽງ/ຍ້າຍຂ້າງດ້ວຍໄຮໂດຣລິກ<br>ເໝາະກັບຫາງລາກ Cat 1/2<br>ຮອງຮັບລະບົ"
"ບຕໍ່ດ່ວນ"

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:product.template,description:agri_equipment_rental.product_product_6_product_template
msgid ""
"25 hp, Gasoline<br>7\" Max Infeed Diameter<br>360° Rotating Discharge "
"Chute<br>Hydraulic Auto-feed"
msgstr ""
"25 ແຮງມ້າ, ແອັດຊັງ<br>ເສັ້ນຜ່າສູນກາງປ້ອນສູງສຸດ 7 ນິ້ວ<br>ທໍ່ພົ່ນໝູນໄດ້ 360 ອົງສາ<br>ປ້ອນໄມ້ອັດຕະໂນມັ"
"ດດ້ວຍໄຮໂດຣລິກ"

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:product.template,description:agri_equipment_rental.product_product_13_product_template
msgid ""
"35 hp, Diesel<br>Hydrostatic Transmission<br>Category 1 Three-Point "
"Hitch<br>540 RPM PTO"
msgstr ""
"35 ແຮງມ້າ, ກາຊວນ<br>ລະບົບເກຍໄຮໂດຣສະແຕຕິກ<br>ຫາງລາກສາມຈຸດ ປະເພດ 1<br>ເພົາ PTO 540 ຮ"
"ອບ/ນາທີ"

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:product.template,description:agri_equipment_rental.product_product_5_product_template
msgid ""
"50 hp, Diesel<br>10,000 L Grain Tank<br>6.5 m Cutting Width<br>GPS Mapping "
"Integrated"
msgstr ""
"50 ແຮງມ້າ, ກາຊວນ<br>ຖັງບັນຈຸເມັດພືດ 10,000 ລິດ<br>ໜ້າກວ້າງກ່ຽວ 6.5 ມ.<br>ຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບແຜນທີ່ "
"GPS ໃນຕົວ"

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:product.template,description:agri_equipment_rental.product_product_9_product_template
msgid "65 hp, Diesel<br>4WD with Differential Lock<br>40 km/h Road Speed"
msgstr ""
"65 ແຮງມ້າ, ກາຊວນ<br>ຂັບເຄື່ອນ 4 ລໍ້ ພ້ອມລະບົບລັອກເຟືອງທ້າຍ<br>ຄວາມໄວແລ່ນເທິງຖະໜົນ 40 ກມ./ຊມ"

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:product.template,description:agri_equipment_rental.product_product_4_product_template
msgid ""
"800cc, Gasoline<br>450 kg Cargo Bed Capacity<br>900 kg Towing "
"Capacity<br>Electronic Power Steering"
msgstr ""
"800cc, ແອັດຊັງ<br>ຄວາມຈຸກfeatureກະບະບັນທຸກ 450 ກິໂລ<br>ກຳລັງລາກແກ່ 900 ກິໂລ<br>ພວງມາໄລ"
"ໄຟຟ້າ"

