"<strong>ແອັບ CRM</strong> ເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ມຸ່ງຫວັງ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍປ່ຽນພວກເຂົາໃຫ້ເປັນສັນຍາ ດ້ວຍຂັ້ນຕອນການ"
"ເຮັດວຽກແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agri_equipment_rental.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>CRM App</strong> lets you capture leads from multiple sources, "
"track them through a pipeline, and follow up effectively using tasks, notes, "
"and chatter communication."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ແອັບ CRM</strong> ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເກັບກຳຜູ້ມຸ່ງຫວັງຈາກຫຼາຍຊ່ອງທາງ, ຕິດຕາມຜ່ານຂະບວນການຂາ"
"ຍ, ແລະ ຕິດຕາມວຽກຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິຜົນ ໂດຍໃຊ້ໜ້າວຽກ, ບັນທຶກ ແລະ ການສົນທະນາ."

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agri_equipment_rental.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>Field Service App</strong> manages delivery, installation, on-"
"site intervention schedules as well as regular servicing and reduces "
"downtime by planning maintenance cycles."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ແອັບບໍລິການພາກສະໜາມ</strong> ຄຸ້ມຄອງການຈັດສົ່ງ, ການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ຕາຕະລາງການລົງພື້ນທີ່ຕົວຈິງ "
"ຕະຫຼອດຮອດການບໍລິການຕາມກຳນົດ ແລະ ຫຼຸດເວລາຢຸດເຮັດວຽກຂອງເຄື່ອງຈັກ ໂດຍການວາງແຜນຮອບວຽນບຳລຸງຮັກສ"
"າ."

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agri_equipment_rental.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>Inventory App</strong> will manage the physical stock of "
"machines, keep track of detailed serial numbers,track usage and returns."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ແອັບສາງສິນຄ້າ</strong> ຈະຄຸ້ມຄອງສາງເຄື່ອງຈັກຕົວຈິງ, ຕິດຕາມເລກລຳດັບລະອຽດ, ຕິດຕາມການ"
"ນຳໃຊ້ ແລະ ການສົ່ງຄືນ."

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agri_equipment_rental.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>Invoicing App</strong> supports recurring billing, deposits, "
"late fees, and equipment damage charges."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ແອັບໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນ</strong> ຮອງຮັບການຮຽກເກັບເງິນແບບປະຈຳ, ເງິນມັດຈຳ, ຄ່າປັບໃໝຊັກຊ້"
"າ ແລະ ຄ່າເສຍຫາຍຂອງອຸປະກອນ."

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agri_equipment_rental.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>Rental App</strong> is designed for planning, scheduling, and "
"managing rental contracts, with visibility over equipment availability and "
"duration."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ແອັບການເຊົ່າ</strong> ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອວາງແຜນ, ກຳນົດເວລາ ແລະ ຄຸ້ມຄອງສັນຍາເຊົ່າ ພ້ອມ"
"ທັງເບິ່ງເຫັນຄວາມພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ໄລຍະເວລາຂອງອຸປະກອນ."

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agri_equipment_rental.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>Rental App</strong> will centralize rental contracts, billing "
"cycles, availability, and reservations."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ແອັບການເຊົ່າ</strong> ຈະລວມສູນສັນຍາເຊົ່າ, ຮອບວຽນການຮຽກເກັບເງິນ, ຄວາມພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານ ແ"
"ລະ ການຈອງໄວ້ບ່ອນດຽວ."

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agri_equipment_rental.welcome_article_body
