#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agri_equipment_rental.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can access every installed App in your Odoo database on your main "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງທຸກແອັບທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ Odoo ຂອງທ່ານ ໄດ້ທີ່ໜ້າກະດານຄວບຄຸມຫຼັກ."

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agri_equipment_rental.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You completed that demo use case! There are millions of other ways to adapt "
